  ~/tmp/eprof2_port.sample.txt      2.4 MB  `sample` call graph, port run 1
  ~/tmp/eprof2_port2.sample.txt     3.5 MB  `sample` call graph, port run 2 (primary)
  ~/tmp/eprof2_libaomc.sample.txt   1.4 MB  `sample` call graph, libaom-c
